@format 1
@id export.commit-modifications
@title Commit preset modifications
@area Export
@entry input
@summary Copy current tab-specific output modifications back into the selected custom preset.
@flow TB
@related export.restore-modifications, export.edit-preset

@alias export = Cadroue.UIShell.PPanels.PExport

[input] Commit modifications requested <input>
- Receive the modified preset's confirmation command @ export.PExportModificationApply(...)
> eligible

[eligible] Check mutability <decision>
- Reject modification of a native preset @ export.PExportModificationApply(...)
? "Selected preset is native" > unchanged
? "Selected custom preset is writable" > commit

[commit] Update preset <process>
- Replace the custom preset with current tab-specific export state @ export.PExportModificationApply(...)
- Refresh the rows and clear modified indication through the export summary update @ export.PExportSummaryUpdate(...)
> result

[result] Preset updated <output>
= The selected custom preset contains the current output settings.

[unchanged] Preset unchanged <output>
= Native preset data is not overwritten.
